-----------------------------+--------------------------------------+----------------------------------------------+\n|Weather Condition|Staffing Recommendation              |Inventory/Menu Recommendation         |Review Risk                                   |\n+-----------------+-------------------------------------+--------------------------------------+----------------------------------------------+\n|Heavy Rain       |Increase delivery staff              |Promote soups, hot food, comfort meals|High — bad weather frustrates customers       |\n|Extreme Heat     |Add outdoor cooling, extra AC staff  |Promote cold drinks, ice cream, salads|Medium — heat reduces walk-ins                |\n|Extreme Cold     |Reduce outdoor seating staff         |Promote hot beverages, soups, stews   |High — cold drives indoor dining              |\n|Heavy Snow       |Reduce floor staff, increase delivery|Focus on delivery-friendly menu items |Very High — snow drastically cuts foot traffic|\n|Snow             |Moderate staffing reduction          |Promote warm comfort food             |Medium — light snow still affects walk-ins    |\n|Strong Wind      |Close outdoor seating entirely       |No special promotions needed          |Low — mainly affects outdoor seating          |\n|Normal           |Standard staffing levels             |Standard menu                         |None — baseline conditions                    |\n+-----------------+-------------------------------------+--------------------------------------+----------------------------------------------+\n\n"},{"type":"TABLE","data":"Weather Condition\tStaffing Recommendation\tInventory/Menu Recommendation\tReview Risk\nHeavy Rain\tIncrease delivery staff\tPromote soups, hot food, comfort meals\tHigh — bad weather frustrates customers\nExtreme Heat\tAdd outdoor cooling, extra AC staff\tPromote cold drinks, ice cream, salads\tMedium — heat reduces walk-ins\nExtreme Cold\tReduce outdoor seating staff\tPromote hot beverages, soups, 